MODIFICATIONS -- every internalised file, and how many guards it carries
========================================================================

Generated from the tree, and kept honest by the property it asserts.  Apply
this transform to any file below and you get FlashInfer v0.6.15, byte for
byte:

    1. strip every `// PIE:` marker, its continuation comments, the
       `#ifndef __CUDACC_RTC__` under it and that directive's matching
       `#endif` -- keeping the guarded BODY, which is upstream's, and
       DISCARDING the `#else` branch, if any, which is ours;
    2. rewrite every `#include <pie/...>` back to the spelling upstream
       wrote, using the map in `tests/upstream_manifest.rs`.

